  "notes": [
    "Reset is the MIP-X43 feed mapping itself (rule 10, price source), executed earlier in the anchor's block, so the age is 0. The config is named by getFeed(\"cbETH\"), not the live getUnderlyingPrice value.",
    "Each liquidation counts seized collateral minus repaid debt at the block's oracle prices (cbETH = ratio x WETH), so each asset's usd is net of repaid debt; the $2.70M sum matches Moonwell's remediation ledger. cbETH adds the cbETH borrowed gross against dust collateral (rule 14)."
